</td>
                <td rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Can occur late</p>
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p><bold>Corneal perforation</bold></p>
</td>
                <td rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Highly likely</p>
</td>
                <td rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Moderate</p>
</td>
                <td rowspan="1" colspan="1">
