<p>High if active cysts remain</p>
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p><bold>Neurotrophic keratopathy</bold></p>
</td>
                <td rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Secondary to melt</p>
</td>
                <td rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Aggressive corticosteroids or toxicity</p>
</td>
                <td rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Common from nerve inflammation</p>
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p><bold>Secondary glaucoma</bold></p>
</td>
                <td rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Inflammation-related</p>
</td>
                <td rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Corticoteroid-induced</p>
</td>
                <td rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Pain-induced corticosteroid overuse risk</p>
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td rowspan="1" colspan="1">
