        </table-wrap>
        <p>
<italic toggle="yes">Abbreviations:</italic>&#x000a0;AC, anterior chamber; TPK, therapeutic penetrating keratoplasty.</p>
        <table-wrap id="article-181910.table34" position="float" orientation="portrait">
